# Agents for Development
For agents that are developing code for the project, please continue to use the most up to date version of Grok on High effort.

# Agents for Submitting to Github
For agents who are submitting or retrieving anything from Github repository, please utilize the most up to date version of Grok on Low effort.

## Agents for all other tasks
Please utilize the most recent version of Grok on Medium effort if the task does not fall into the above categories.
